B. Model and tokenizer
----------------------

The GGUF files (https://huggingface.co/andrelucas/Julia-1-GGUF) are converted from the Julia-1 checkpoint by llama.cpp's
convert_hf_to_gguf.py (llama.cpp master with pull request #29818, MIT License, text (1)); the files of julia1-cli 0.1.0
by tools/convert_julia1_to_gguf.py. They carry the weights of Julia-1 and the encoder and tokenizer that Julia-1
inherits from mmBERT-small.

