  Julia-1 (weights, decision     https://huggingface.co/SupersonicLabs/Julia-1       Apache License 2.0 (6)
    head, reference code,
    tokenizer files)
  mmBERT-small (encoder and      https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small        MIT (7)
    tokenizer Julia-1 builds on)

